// Title: C# – Suppress Excel Cell Comments in PDF Export with Aspose.Cells
// Description: Shows how to omit worksheet comments from the PDF generated by Aspose.Cells for .NET. The sample adds a comment, configures PageSetup.PrintComments = PrintNoComments, and saves a clean PDF without comment markers.
// Keywords: Aspose.Cells PDF export without comments | PrintCommentsType.PrintNoComments C# | hide Excel comments in PDF | Aspose.Cells disable comment printing | C# PDF conversion clean layout
// Common Searches: Aspose.Cells hide comments when saving as PDF | C# prevent Excel comments appearing in PDF | PrintComments property Aspose.Cells example | remove cell comments from PDF export | clean PDF from Excel using Aspose.Cells
// Developer Intent: Exclude all worksheet comments from the PDF produced by Aspose.Cells.
